s}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span> is the transitivity predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}accessibility\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}accessibility\\text{-}transitive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 可达关系 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"642c63ec0f3c8567\" href=\"?note=642c63ec0f3c8567\" title=\"89-df-accessibility\">89-df-accessibility</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> : GL框架 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>)</li>\n<li>GL框架的可达关系是传递的</li>\n<li>对应4公理<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box p\">\\(\\Box p \\rightarrow \\Box \\Box p\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-accessibility","status":"resolved","id":"642c63ec0f3c8567","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-accessibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-3","targe